### 1. Update NotificationWriterService.java
Find the createNextStepApprovalNotification method (around line 77) and update its signature and message text:
```java
    /**
     * Alerts the Checkers that a batch is waiting for them.
     * As per architecture, USER_ID is strictly NULL so it maps cleanly to TARGET_ROLE.
     */
    public void createNextStepApprovalNotification(String batchId, String targetRoleId, String stageName) {
        // Fallback just in case the stageName is missing from the DB
        String stageDisplay = (stageName != null && !stageName.isBlank()) ? "'" + stageName + "'" : "the next stage";
        
        // Exact requested wording
        String message = "Voucher Batch '" + batchId + "' has advanced to " + stageDisplay + " and requires review.";
        
        // First parameter (userId) is explicitly forced to null
        createNotification(null, targetRoleId, message, "/voucher-authorization", batchId, "VoucherService");
    }

```
